## 🛡️ ZERO-ARTIFACT GUARANTEE

When Alex AI is active:
- No files are created in the project unless explicitly requested
- All temporary data stored in isolated .alex-ai-artifacts/ directory
- Memory storage goes to Supabase via N8N (not local files)
- Git repository remains clean
- Automatic cleanup after session

